  "description": "GdUnit4 Analyzers is a collection of Roslyn-based analyzers that provide compile-time validation for GdUnit4 test attributes.\n      It helps developers catch configuration errors early by enforcing correct attribute usage and combinations.",
  "developmentDependency": true,
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
